WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.830
On a dark night twelve years ago, somewhere
in the East Blue, a young kid is trapped in

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:08.300
a cage on a ship that is sailing away from
his home island.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:13.900
He is shouting and swinging his fists at anyone
in reach, but the crew is too strong to care.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.830
Then a figure in a long, green cloak walks
up, kneels in front of the child and pulls

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:19.950
back his hood.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.990
The furious child launches a punch, but the
man with the mysterious tattoo easily blocks

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.740
it, and pulls the child tight against the
bars.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:28.929
“Where are you taking me?”

00:00:28.929 --> 00:00:29.929
the child screams.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:33.030
And all the mysterious man says is “your
new home”.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:35.510
This child is Monkey D. Luffy.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.510
And the man?

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:42.020
He is the most wanted man in the world, and
the child’s father, Monkey D. dragon.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:47.390
Which means that even though Luffy would probably
fight and scream the entire voyage, in this

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:51.760
what if scenario there is literally nothing
he can do to stop his father from taking him

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.340
to the Revolutionary Army base to raise him
as a Revolutionary.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:01:04.140
And wow, this is absolutely going to COMPLETELY
change Luffy’s life in SO MANY ways.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:10.040
Some of which are bad, and surprisingly some
that are incredibly awesome.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:15.360
First though, Luffy would care one bit that
Dragon is his father.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.909
I mean, when he originally learned about his
father he didn’t care at all, and I think

00:01:19.909 --> 00:01:21.880
the same would apply here.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:26.530
But once they get back to the revolutionary
army’s base, I think Luffy’s attitude

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:28.700
will eventually start to change.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:33.619
Because at this point, Dragon’s group of
freedom fighters is FULL of people that Luffy

00:01:33.619 --> 00:01:38.200
became friends with later on anyway, like
this huge cyborg guy who saved Luffy at the

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.200
end of Sabaody.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:44.500
Plus Ivankov, who literally saved Luffy’s
life during the prison break before the war

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.500
at Marineford.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:51.080
So knowing Luffy he will start to make friends
and be happy here pretty quickly because if

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:55.969
you remember from his flashback, Luffy truly
just wanted some friends to hang out with

00:01:55.969 --> 00:01:56.969
all along.

00:01:56.969 --> 00:02:01.490
So maybe coming to his father’s base might
be a good thing.

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:06.450
I mean, he’ll definitely find some better
mentors than a band of mountain bandits.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:13.170
That’s just the start though because you
WILL NOT BELIEVE how much stronger Revolutionary

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.720
Luffy is going to become.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:21.500
First of all, we can assume that Dragon knows
haki, so he’d probably teach Luffy the basics

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:23.680
as he grew up.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:27.870
So add Armament and Observation haki to Luffy’s
arsenal.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:32.160
Plus, there are also other characters with
devil fruits at the Revolutionary's base,

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:36.970
so they might help Luffy master his powers
even faster since he really didn’t know

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:40.140
anyone with a devil fruit back on his home
island.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:44.459
On top of that, there are other fighting styles
Luffy could learn.

00:02:44.459 --> 00:02:49.480
For example, this revolutionary fishman is
a master of fishman karate, which is used

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:54.730
by the fishmen to control water, but is also
an extrememly strong martial arts form.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:03:00.160
There is also Ivankavo’s Newkama kempo,
which Sanji mastered during the time skip.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:04.920
So yeah, this version of Luffy is going to
have way more training and fighting techniques

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:07.750
than he did originally.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:12.330
Things are about to get even more crazy though
because when Luffy was eight years old, there

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:18.580
was ANOTHER super important child that Dragon
rescued and brought to the revolutionary base.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:24.549
Of course I’m talking about Sabo, who originally
grew up with Luffy and Ace in the forests

00:03:24.549 --> 00:03:25.659
of their home island.

00:03:25.659 --> 00:03:31.470
However, once he learned just how awful the
rulers of the kingdom were, he decided to

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:34.860
flee the kingdom to start a life at sea.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:41.390
Unfortunately, he was quickly sunk by a world
noble, and was rescued by Dragon and then

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:42.830
raised as a Revolutionary.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:48.010
So add an ally to the party because Luffy
is now going to have a new best friend.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:54.810
And wow, can you just imagine the fun AND
trouble these two would get into running around

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:56.170
the Revolutionary Army base?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:04:00.370
They might even destroy the entire thing if
we’re being honest, but not only that they’d

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:04.160
also have a super important role to play in
each other’s lives.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:10.420
You see, after Sabo was blown up he lost his
memories and completely forgot his life at

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:11.420
the Goa kingdom.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:16.079
However, that’s all going to change because
I can just imagine when Luffy mentions he

00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:21.410
was from the Goa kingdom Sabo most likely
would regain those memories that he had lost.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:26.830
And although that wouldn’t include his time
growing up with Luffy because that didn’t

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:32.830
happen in this scenario, Sabo would remember
Ace, which is going to play a very important

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.000
role in just a minute.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.440
In fact, once he regains his memories Sabo
might desperately want to go back to the Goa

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:44.470
kingdom or at least send a message to let
Ace know he is still alive.&nbsp;

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:49.310
And they might even try to convince Ace to
join the Revolutionaries, but for now we are

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:53.500
going to leave Ace to follow his normal path
to becoming a pirate.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:59.220
Now at this point you might be wondering why
Dragon wanted to bring Luffy here in the first

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:00.220
place.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:07.000
And while there could be many reasons, the
one that makes the most sense to me is that

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:11.229
Dragon might know the true secrets of Luffy’s
devil fruit awakening.

00:05:11.229 --> 00:05:16.729
So when he learns that he son has eaten these
powers, then he will want to raise Luffy himself

00:05:16.729 --> 00:05:21.860
to give him the best opportunity to one day
awaken Gear 5, which is actually the perfect

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:26.560
power for a revolutionary freedom fighter.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:31.660
Back to child Luffy though, perhaps the most
GAME-CHANGING thing about Luffy growing up

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:36.290
with the Revolutionaries is that there is
NO WAY that Dragon can keep them on the island

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.290
forever.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:42.360
So eventually these two would be taken out
on missions all over the world.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:47.280
And during this time both of the boys and
this revolutionary girl will learn so much

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.280
about the world.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:55.539
I mean originally Luffy had literally ZERO
formal education but now he would likely learn

00:05:55.539 --> 00:06:02.460
about different kingdoms, races, and probably
even really practical stuff like how to sail

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.460
a ship.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.510
Which we all know he never learned that skill.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:11.390
On top of all that, they would learn about
the world government’s oppression and dark

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:16.310
secrets, along with the Revolutionary Army’s
true goals of taking down the world nobles.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:21.780
Now you might be thinking that Luffy wouldn’t
really care about that stuff, and normally

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:27.440
you would be right, but I think this version
of Luffy would be exposed to so many suffering

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:34.599
people that he would also develop a belief
that the world nobles are truly evil.

00:06:34.599 --> 00:06:39.460
All this would lead to a slightly more mature
version of Luffy.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:43.759
Although I do have to admit, I just can’t
imagine Luffy ever being the type of person

00:06:43.759 --> 00:06:46.330
you would want to take on secret spy missions.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:50.250
He’s not exactly the sneaky type.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:56.070
But eventually Luffy, Sabo, and Koala would
probably be given their own missions to recruit

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:59.129
new members or free oppressed kingdoms.

00:06:59.129 --> 00:07:04.729
However, Luffy as a Revolutionary is still
going to have a MASSIVE problem.

00:07:04.729 --> 00:07:10.440
You see, in this scenario, Luffy still has
his devil fruit, he was still inspired by

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:13.160
Shanks, and he still received the straw hat.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.599
So deep down he still dreams of being a pirate.

00:07:16.599 --> 00:07:24.129
So let’s say around age seventeen, Luffy
just one day decides it’s time to follow

00:07:24.129 --> 00:07:25.720
that inner dream.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:33.541
Now Dragon might be furious and even want
to stop him since he knows all the Revolutionary

00:07:33.541 --> 00:07:37.210
Army’s secrets, but eventually he’d let
him go.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:40.710
I mean he already basically approved of Luffy
being a pirate.

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:46.199
And besides Dragon, Sabo would probably be
the most heartbroken because even though Luffy

00:07:46.199 --> 00:07:52.310
would probably try to recruit Sabo and Koala
to join him, those two would probably stick

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:54.280
with the Revolutionaries.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:59.840
Luffy simply can’t set sail on his own though,
at least not in the Grand Line, so let’s

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:05.210
say the Revolutionaries drop him off back
in the East Blue and he starts his journey

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.210
like normal.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:11.240
And while his adventure is going to start
out the same, you’re going to be SHOCKED

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:15.310
at how quickly Revolutionary Luffy’s pirate
adventure is going to end.

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:20.000
But first, I still think he recruits his crewmates
like normal, so hop on board, everyone with

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:24.350
the only main difference in the East Blue
being that Luffy is way stronger since he

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.791
knows haki already.

00:08:26.791 --> 00:08:31.009
So he would fly through his enemies here,
freeing the villages from the bad guys.

00:08:31.009 --> 00:08:33.960
Man, his father would be proud.

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:39.190
And even the man who gave Luffy his first
real defeat would simply be no match for this

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:41.810
Haki and Karate buffed up Luffy.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:46.190
Which means that most of the pre-timeskip
arcs will continue like normal, although there

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:50.950
are a few super important changes that would
just make too much sense with this more mature

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:52.350
and politically aware Luffy.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:57.030
For example, in Alabasta Luffy might call
up Sabo and let him know what is going on

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.350
with the civil war.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:02.580
And if the revolutionaries knew about this,
they might even come help stop the people

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:05.670
from destroying each other alongside Luffy
and the crew.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:13.089
Which would also be THE PERFECT opportunity
for Sabo to reunite with Ace, since Ace was

00:09:13.089 --> 00:09:14.750
also briefly present here.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:20.600
And this means Luffy gets to meet the fiery
brother he never had, which is going to play

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:23.089
a big role in the story later on.

00:09:23.089 --> 00:09:27.870
Besides that though, there’s really not
a whole lot that would change during the pre-time

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:28.870
skip arcs.

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:33.520
That is until we reach the government island
Enies Lobby where Luffy and the crew try to

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.860
save Robin from these secret agents.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:41.079
And if we’re keeping up with the idea that
Luffy and Sabo are in frequent contact, then

00:09:41.079 --> 00:09:46.010
I can see the Revolutionaries taking advantage
of the chaos on the government island.

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:49.970
Maybe they sneak in and steal some valuable
info or something like that.

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:55.310
So after the Straw Hats rescue Robin, we reach
the first MAJOR MAJOR change during Luffy’s

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:58.720
encounter with the former Revolutionary Kuma
on Thriller Bark.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:02.860
And since Luffy is already way stronger at
this point, he’d probably have a much easier

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:07.600
time defeating this shadow guy which means
he will be awake for the epic confrontation

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:08.880
at the end of this arc.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:13.720
Now, I won’t get into heavy manga spoilers
here, but wow, this scene hits way harder

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:18.880
with what we know about Kuma now, and I cannot
even imagine how much it would break Luffy

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:23.180
to see that his friend Kuma has been turned
into a government slave.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:27.890
But now we have to ask if Kuma would ever
follow through with his orders and actually

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.730
try to kill Luffy.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:36.911
You have to remember that for the purpose
of this video, Luffy grew up with the Revolutionaries

00:10:36.911 --> 00:10:40.310
and would definitely have known Kuma.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:44.810
So the Warlord might just straight up refuse
to kill his former friend, so it’s entirely

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:49.590
possible that we never get the nothing happened
moment.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:54.750
On top of that, I can say that the most devastating
moments in the entire story would also be

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.260
way different.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:11:00.089
Because Sabaody is the point in the story
when the straw hats truly learned just how

00:11:00.089 --> 00:11:05.290
evil the celestial dragons are, and exactly
how outmatched they were when facing the marine

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.290
admirals.

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:10.920
So considering what Luffy now knows about
the world nobles, he might go even further

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:15.090
than just punching this guy and might actually
kill the man.

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:21.589
Which is extreme, I know, but Revolutionary
Luffy is a different man.

00:11:21.589 --> 00:11:26.790
But that’s just the first possible change
because we also simply have to reevaluate

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.280
what would happen at the end of this arc.

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:34.760
Because before Luffy and the crew did not
trust Kuma at all, so when he came in making

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:37.350
everyone disappear there was mass panic.

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:42.960
But in this scenario Luffy should be able
to figure out that Kuma is trying to help

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:43.960
them.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:47.980
So instead of absolutely losing their minds
as Kuma sent each member away, they might

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:52.070
be more willing to go along with what Kuma
was doing.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:56.730
However, that’s just the start of the insanity
because now things are really going to heat

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.310
up for Revolutionary Luffy.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:02.350
Because at this point I think Kuma would change
where he sends Luffy.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:10.071
And instead of landing on Amazon Lily, Luffy
instead lands where he grew up at the Revolutionary

00:12:10.071 --> 00:12:11.079
Army base.

00:12:11.079 --> 00:12:16.171
That is of course assuming that Kuma knows
where the current base was on Baltigo, but

00:12:16.171 --> 00:12:18.089
let’s imagine that he does.

00:12:18.089 --> 00:12:23.380
So Luffy crash lands on his father’s doorstep,
which of course he probably would not like

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.380
at all.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:29.459
But more importantly, he will soon learn about
a major world that is going to change everything.

00:12:29.459 --> 00:12:35.019
That’s because it is at this time that news
spreads about Ace’s capture and execution

00:12:35.019 --> 00:12:36.019
date.

00:12:36.019 --> 00:12:42.160
And even though Luffy didn’t grow up with
Ace, Sabo did for much of his childhood, and

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:45.769
I think both of them would absolutely want
to free Ace.

00:12:45.769 --> 00:12:49.560
Which means that the Revolutionaries are going
to suit up for battle.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:54.000
And while Dragon would probably think an assault
on Impel down is too risky, I could see them

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.290
joining the chaotic war at Marineford.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:02.070
So get ready because Luffy AND Sabo are about
to crash this massive party.

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:09.010
And while it might be simply awesome for Dragon
to also show up, I think he might take advantage

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:15.440
of the distraction to sneak into Impel Down
himself and free his second in command, Ivankov.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.510
But back to the war.

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:21.040
So with Luffy and Sabo here to fight, they
quickly team up with the Whitebeard allies

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.290
to try to free Ace.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:27.910
And while I don’t really think the Revolutionaries
would send their entire army, as long as they

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:33.029
have a small enough squad of powerful fighters
like the Revolutionary Army Commanders they

00:13:33.029 --> 00:13:37.430
should make a big impact on the battle.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:44.660
In fact, Belo Betty’s powers might be perfect
for an all out war like this, since she can

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:49.710
encourage their allies to fight even harder
with her devil fruit.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:55.779
Plus with this upgraded version of Luffy and
an equally powerful Sabo, I really think that

00:13:55.779 --> 00:13:59.459
they are strong enough to free Ace AND survive.

00:13:59.459 --> 00:14:03.839
And since we’re already here, let’s say
Luffy goes way over the top and once again

00:14:03.839 --> 00:14:09.320
declares war on the world government, but
this time he says it as a Revolutionary and

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:15.699
even plants a revolutionary flag in front
of the entire marine forces.

00:14:15.699 --> 00:14:18.140
Which is going to change EVERYTHING.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:23.509
That’s right, it’s time for Luffy to rejoin
the Revolutionary Army.

00:14:23.509 --> 00:14:27.820
Because with everything that Luffy has seen
and experienced up to this point, I think

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:32.610
it is reasonable to think he would fully commit
to taking down the world nobles.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:37.690
Which means goodbye to the pirate adventures
for now, but this Luffy would likely care

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:44.130
way more about freeing all the oppressed people
in the world, so this change makes sense to

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:45.130
me.

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:49.940
That means Luffy and Sabo will be permanently
reunited, although I’m not sure if Luffy

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:55.880
would be second-in-command and bump Sabo down
or if they would be like co-second in commands

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:56.880
or something.

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:02.000
But the important thing is Luffy is back with
the Revolutionaries, which was the whole point

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.000
of this video.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:09.170
That also means that the straw hats will be
joining up as well, and it is honestly nuts

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:16.690
to think how perfectly each of the straw hats'
dreams still can be reached once they become

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:17.690
revolutionaries.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:22.579
Nami can still travel and make her maps, plus
the revolutionaries probably even have their

00:15:22.579 --> 00:15:26.290
own secret maps that she would love to explore.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:30.940
There are still tons of strong enemies to
fight for Zoro to grow as a swordsman.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.910
Robin already had ties with the Revolutionaries.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.519
Chopper can still study medicine.

00:15:36.519 --> 00:15:37.519
And so on.

00:15:37.519 --> 00:15:41.310
As for Ace, I think he’d probably want to
stick with the Whitebeard pirates, especially

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:45.000
if we assume that the former Emperor still
died during the battle.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:49.820
But even without Ace, the Revolutionaries
just got a massive power boost.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:54.410
Because after some time training for the Straw
Hats to get stronger, we can easily say that

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:59.839
Luffy is one of the top two or three fighters
in the organization.

00:15:59.839 --> 00:16:05.880
Zoro and Sanji are probably top six or seven,
and the rest of the crew are huge additions

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:08.430
to the overall strength of the entire Army.

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:13.079
And with this added power, I could even see
the Revoiutionaries step up their mission

00:16:13.079 --> 00:16:16.600
to take down the Celestial Dragons AND free
oppressed countries.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:21.029
In fact, the crew might even still visit many
of the same islands.

00:16:21.029 --> 00:16:26.509
For example, fishman island was about to be
taken over by this evil fishman, so they could

00:16:26.509 --> 00:16:27.860
use someone to save them.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:30.380
Dressrosa was oppressed by Doflamingo.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:35.759
Wano had literally become a wasteland under
the Emperor Kaido, so I could easily see Luffy

00:16:35.759 --> 00:16:40.960
and the Revolutionaries still going to these
places to free more countries and gain more

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:45.790
allies, even though Luffy wouldn’t have
direct ties with characters like Law and Momonoske

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:46.790
at this point.

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:52.440
But in the end it would be just so fitting
if Luffy still unlocks Gear 5 and his advanced

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:58.660
haki during the fight with Kaido, since he
is a true symbol of freedom and liberation.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:05.150
But all of this is leading up to the undeniable
future clash with the marines and world government.

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:09.870
And while we are still waiting to see how
that would go, I can just imagine with all

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:15.400
the allies of the Revolutionaires, plus a
fully awakened Luffy and the crew, that they

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:20.250
would be able to take down the World Government
and free the world.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:25.110
However, that does actually leave one major
problem.

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:28.610
Because fighting the marines would put them
directly against family and friends such as

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:33.470
Garp and Luffy’s old friend Koby, who are
both going to be incredibly powerful characters

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:34.470
at this point.

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:39.080
I mean Koby went from this wimpy kid to being
an absolute chad.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:43.210
And now that I’m thinking about it, I wonder
what would have happened if instead of Luffy

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:48.679
training with his dad, he actually followed
his Grandpa’s wish to become a marine.

00:17:48.679 --> 00:17:53.910
So if you want to see exactly how that would
turn out, you can watch this video right here.

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:57.330
Shanks for watching and I’ll see you in
the next one.

